 ## Quick Start
 
+### For users WITH CUDA (GPU support)
+```bash
+# Clone the repository
+git clone https://github.com/prim8/haive.git
+cd haive
+
+# Install with CUDA support (default)
+poetry install --extras cuda
+```
+
+### For users WITHOUT CUDA (CPU-only)
+```bash
+# Clone the repository  
+git clone https://github.com/prim8/haive.git
+cd haive
+
+# Install CPU-only version
+poetry install --extras cpu
+
+# OR manually specify CPU PyTorch sources
+poetry source add pytorch_cpu https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu --priority=explicit
+poetry install --extras cpu
+```
+
+### Alternative CPU Installation
+If you encounter issues with the above, you can manually install PyTorch CPU first:
 ```bash
