index 61da61ae..88926fbd 100644
--- a/project_docs/claude_documentation/CLAUDE_TIPS.md
+++ b/project_docs/claude_documentation/CLAUDE_TIPS.md
@@ -156,3 +156,104 @@ Don't use for:
 - Quick commands (< 30 seconds)
 - Commands that need interactive input
 - Commands where you need immediate error feedback
+
+
+---
+
+## Claude Code Background Process Research
+
+### Known Claude Code Timeout Issues
+
+Based on GitHub issues (#2489, #821) and community reports:
+
+1. **CLI Timeout Bug**: Default 1000ms timeout insufficient under normal conditions
+2. **WSL Session Timeout**: After one prompt, subsequent prompts timeout 
+3. **Request Timeouts**: API calls timing out with retry loops
+4. **No Configurable Timeouts**: Timeout settings are hardcoded (~2 minutes)
+
+### Background Process Solutions for Claude Code
+
+#### 1. Basic nohup Usage
+```bash
+# Standard nohup pattern for any long command
+nohup command_here > output.log 2>&1 &
+
+# For our documentation builds
+nohup poetry run nox -s docs_fast > build.log 2>&1 &
+```
+
+#### 2. Advanced nohup with setsid (for Python signal issues)
+```bash
+# Use setsid to prevent Python signal handling issues
+setsid nohup python3 your_script.py > nohup.out &
+
+# For our builds
+setsid nohup poetry run nox -s docs_fast > build.log 2>&1 &
+```
+
+#### 3. tmux Alternative (Recommended for Interactive Work)
+```bash
+# Start tmux session
+tmux new -s build_session
+
+# Run your command
+poetry run nox -s docs_fast
+
+# Detach: Ctrl+B then D
+# Reattach: tmux attach -t build_session
+```
+
+### Why This Matters for Claude Code
+
+Claude Code has inherent limitations:
+- **Hardcoded timeouts** (~2 minutes for command execution)
+- **No user configuration** for timeout settings
+- **WSL-specific issues** in Windows environments  
+- **Node.js process limits** in CLI implementation
+
+### Best Practices When Using Claude Code
+
+1. **Always use nohup for long-running tasks**:
+   ```bash
+   nohup poetry run sphinx-build docs/source docs/build/html > build.log 2>&1 &
+   ```
+
+2. **Monitor background processes**:
+   ```bash
+   # Check if still running
+   ps aux  < /dev/null |  grep sphinx-build
+   
+   # Watch logs in real-time
+   tail -f build.log
+   ```
+
+3. **Use tmux for development sessions**:
+   ```bash
+   tmux new -s work
+   # Do your work
+   # Ctrl+B, D to detach
+   tmux attach -t work  # Reattach later
+   ```
+
+4. **Handle Python signal issues if needed**:
+   ```bash
+   # If nohup processes still get killed
+   setsid nohup your_command > output.log &
+   ```
+
+### Configuration Notes
+
+Claude Code supports configuration through:
+- Environment variables
+- Global settings: `~/.claude/settings.json`  
+- Project settings: `.claude/settings.json`
+
+However, **timeout settings are NOT configurable** and remain hardcoded.
+
+### GitHub Issues to Track
+
+- **#2489**: Timeout error after 1000ms in Claude Code CLI
+- **#821**: WSL session timeout after first prompt
+- **#424**: MCP timeout needs to be configurable
+- **#743**: Request for token/time based timeout configuration
+
